('58b446c8-a4dc-459b-a90a-0864836f904e', 'statistics_probability', 'year_7', 'proficient', 'short_answer', 'The bar chart shows cars sold each month. What is the range of the number of cars sold?', null, null, 'Range = highest − lowest = 18 − 9 = 9.', 'AC9M7ST01', null, null, true, '9', null, null, null),
