('e884cb68-2f76-4a6c-b458-4ddc0aaf7488', 'algebra_equations', 'year_7', 'proficient', 'short_answer', 'The number line shows a temperature pattern over three days, increasing by the same amount each day. If the pattern continues, what temperature (°C) would Day 5 be?', null, null, 'Each day increases by 3°C (5 − 2 = 3, 8 − 5 = 3). Day 4 = 11°C, Day 5 = 14°C.', 'AC9M7A01', null, null, true, '14', ARRAY['14°C', '14 degrees']::text[], null, null),
