('4d066aa3-091f-4c8e-8e33-6f3c8d5cd358', 'number_operations', 'year_8', 'foundation', 'multiple_choice', 'In a science report, a student writes a quantity as 2³ × 2². Simplify this expression using index laws.', '["2¹","2⁵","2⁶","4⁵"]'::jsonb, 1, 'When multiplying powers with the same base, add the exponents: 3 + 2 = 5.', 'AC9M8N02', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
