('85cb6372-b1b3-4e87-9be5-b6cece3d8c9b', 'number_operations', 'year_7', 'developing', 'multiple_choice', 'In a golf tournament, a player finishes 3 strokes under par on each of 4 rounds. Using −3 × 4, what is the player''s total score relative to par?', '["−12","12","−7","7"]'::jsonb, 0, 'A negative times a positive gives a negative: −3 × 4 = −12.', 'AC9M7N02', null, null, true, null, null, null, null),
